  isCrystal: 0
  difficulty: 1
  description: "Three soft, round blooms nod atop a single stalk like little cotton
    balls, shedding a fine gold dust at the gentlest touch, a breath of wind is enough
    to set the whole plant drifting. \n\nThe gentlest teacher in the greenhouse.
    Its pollen doesn't feed or heal anything, it simply tells you, plainly, what
    a plant is missing before you have to guess."
  descriptionSecondary: "Dust a puffball over any pot and a coloured marker appears
    over it showing whichever need is currently lowest, for a short time.\n\nYellow
    for light\nBlue for water\nBrown for soil \n"
